### 8. Risk Planning

| Risk                              | Solution                                   |
| --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| Incorrect expense calculations    | Test calculations with different inputs    |
| Database errors                   | Use validation and regular backups         |
| AI recommendations are inaccurate | Use clear rules and verified spending data |
| Login/security problems           | Implement proper authentication            |
| Development delays                | Follow the project schedule                |
| Software errors                   | Perform regular testing and debugging      |

### 9. Expected Outcome

At the end of the project, PocketSmart AI should provide a working platform where users can enter their financial information, monitor their spending, set budgets, and receive personalized recommendations based on their recorded expenses.

### 10. Conclusion

The **Project Planning Phase** creates a clear roadmap for developing PocketSmart AI. Proper planning helps organize the project requirements, resources, modules, schedule, and risks.

This phase provides the foundation for the next stages: **Project Design → Project Development → Project Testing → Project Documentation → Final Demonstration**.
